config SSF_SENSOR
	tristate "SSF Modbus sensor driver"
	depends on SERIAL_DEV_BUS
	select CRC16
	help
	  Build the SSF sensor driver for a Modbus RTU device connected through
	  the Linux serial-device (serdev) bus.  The driver is structured into
	  transport, protocol, sensor, core, and data subsystems.

	  Select M to build a loadable module named ssf_sensor.ko, or Y to link
	  it into the kernel.
